WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.682
Unstructured data does not naturally arrive as a
table A clinical

00:00:05.709 --> 00:00:11.264
note contains useful information but the meaning is
embedded in text An image

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:18.074
contains visual information Audio contains signals
over time To

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:23.916
analyze these sources we usually need an extraction
step such as NLP computer vision OCR

00:00:24.166 --> 00:00:30.063
or speech processing After extraction some
information may become structured

00:00:30.089 --> 00:00:33.168
features that can be analyzed alongside relational
data
